Z||000000||Matthew_Fiero||12-02-2001||07:38 PM||||Hey, i have a stupid question, but i need to comfirm it. I have a 1985 GT 4 speed<BR>does it have the isuzu or the muncie?<P>also, i installed the 88 style motors and wiring harness for my headlights and everything works perfectly, but for some reason the driver side headlight still sticks up an inch, i have tried to manually lower the motor the rest of the way but it is all the way down, is there a way to adjust it?<BR>Thanks<BR>Matthew||||reg||1
