Z||000005||Oreif||12-03-2001||02:41 PM||||There are only 3 types of manual transmissions in Fiero's.<BR>84, 85-86 4-spds are all muncie's. The 84 gear ratios are different but it's the same basic trans.<BR>85-88 4-cyl 5-spds are Isuzu's<BR>late 86-88 V-6 5-spds are Muncie-Getrag's<P>If you have a different trans combo/year than above, someone swapped them around.||||reg||1
